{
  "job_B9.7.4_20251003_115119": {
    "chunk_text": "man, \u00fee simle for Godes ege forhte\u00f0, & him forgyfen by\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he simle Godes ege hafe\u00f0 Se \u00fee him ondr\u00e6de\u00f0 God, he abug\u00f0 fram \u00e6lcen \u00feweoren si\u00f0f\u00e6te, & gerecce\u00f0 his weges to m\u00e6gnes Se Godes ege, he ut adrif\u00f0 \u00fea synnen, & he gegadere\u00f0 m\u00e6ign. Se Godes ege gede\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t se mann by\u00f0 w\u00e6rr, & behealden wi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t he ne syngige. \u00de\u00e6re se Godes ege ne by\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6re by\u00f0 ealles lifes talnesse. Se \u00fee him God on gesunden \u00feingen ne ondr\u00e6de\u00f0, on ungesunden he to him ne beflih\u00f0, he for \u00fean Eadig by\u00f0 se were, se \u00fee God ondr\u00e6t, & on his beboden by\u00f0 swy\u00f0e geornfull. Se Godes ege, he ut adrif\u00f0 \u00feone helle ege. Swa ondr\u00e6den we us God, \u00fe\u00e6t we hine lufigen, for \u00fean \u00fee seo fullfremede lufe ut adrif\u00f0 \u00feone De ieiunio.",
